386→                        <div id="content">Can the product of an arithmetic progression of positive integers $n,n+d,\ldots,n+(k-1)d$ of length $k\geq 4$ (with $(n,d)=1$) be a perfect power?</div>
387→                        <div id="problem_id"><a href="/672">#672</a>: <a href="#cite-Er97c-672" onclick="event.preventDefault();addNewBox('Er97c','672'); return false;">[Er97c]</a><a href="#cite-Va99-672" onclick="event.preventDefault();addNewBox('Va99','672'); return false;">[Va99,1.32]</a></div>
